{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Protective Styles & Coil Compatibility Guide
  Designed to resonate with Black women's daily hair routines:
  braids, twists, lace-front wigs, locs, and raw 4C natural patterns.
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-editorial-section zvhc-protective-styles-section" id="protective-styles" style="padding: 72px 0; background: #FAF7F2; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 52px;">
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #F8E4EB; color: #B0476E; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 9999px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <span>✦ ENGINEERED FOR HOW YOU WEAR YOUR HAIR</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #2B1B24;">
        Protective Style &amp; Coil Compatibility
      </h2>
      <p style="color: #5A4651; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Whether you are rocking fresh knotless braids, living in lace front wigs, maintaining your locs, or embracing your raw 4C crown — Zavelyn shields your roots from tension damage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Protective Style Cards -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Knotless & Box Braids -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAD7DD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(43,27,36,0.04);">
        <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 18px;">
          ✨
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          Knotless Braids &amp; Twists
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B0476E; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Tension Relief &amp; Parting Care
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1;">
          Apply 2–3 drops directly along exposed scalp partings. Instantly cools and soothes day-one tension throbbing while preventing edge thinning from heavy braid weight.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Lace Front Wigs & Weaves -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAD7DD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(43,27,36,0.04);">
        <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 18px;">
          👑
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          Lace Front Wigs &amp; Weaves
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B0476E; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Adhesive &amp; Friction Recovery
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1;">
          Rescue receding hairlines stripped by ghost bond adhesives and wig cap friction. Deep batana phytosterols regenerate dormant follicles without leaving greasy residue under wig caps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Locs & Micro-Locs -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAD7DD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(43,27,36,0.04);">
        <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 18px;">
          🌿
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          Locs &amp; Micro-Locs
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B0476E; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Zero Buildup &amp; Clean Hydration
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1;">
          Never worry about white waxy residue or trapped lint inside your locs. Pure Batana absorbs 100% clean, keeping locs soft, flexible, and smelling of rich roasted botanical nuts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Type 4A-4C Natural Coils -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAD7DD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(43,27,36,0.04);">
        <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 18px;">
          🤎
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          Type 3A–4C Natural Coils
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B0476E; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          72-Hour L.O.C. Moisture Seal
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1;">
          The holy grail sealant for twist-outs, braid-outs, and wash &amp; go routines. Locks hydration deep into coarse, high-porosity strands, preventing single-strand knots and comb snap.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC Protective Styles",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
